  "body": [
    "With the ‘COOL’ feature, the automotive group helps customers identify the ideal moment for especially green charging and uses playful incentives to encourage climate-friendly behaviour.",
    "Reply's Global Test Automation Center is reshaping the landscape of EV charging testing with its end-to-end Test Automation Framework.",
    "Reply has developed an innovative solution for the electric vehicle (EV) market, mapping charging stations in Europe.",
    "The mobility industry is experiencing an in-depth transformation. The future of mobility is driven by digital services and IT will be the backbone of the entire extended mobility ecosystem.",
    "Advancing energy transition through technological innovation",
    "Renewables",
    "Production from renewable sources around the world is expected to continue to grow in the coming years, driven by new technologies and supported by new business models.",
    "Electrification",
    "The 20s are the electric decade: the process of replacing technologies that use fossil fuels (such as coal, oil and natural gas, hydrogen) with technologies that run on electricity is driven by the achievement of climate goals.",
    "Grid infrastructure",
    "As renewable energy continues to grow, infrastructure challenges will increase in importance, requiring support for new services and new market rules, while also ensuring grid balance.",
    "Digitization",
    "Production, assets and infrastructure, end-user devices. Digital supports renewed customer, enables intelligent energy and power management solutions based on automation and data interaction, and supports employee operations.",
    "Sustainability",
    "The energy transition passes through the development of circular economy initiatives and strategies aimed at introducing an efficient and sustainable use of energy.",
    "Discover A2A Energia's path of transformation of business processes from a data-driven perspective, thanks to the adoption of innovative advanced analytics solutions, and AI and Machine Learning models.",
    "Data Reply has developed a quantum algorithm that allows Enel to quickly plan the maintenance work performed by units operating throughout Italy.",
    "Sense Reply supported a global energy operator, with an integrated IoT platform for energy asset management and access to the energy flexibility market.",
    "The energy landscape is rapidly evolving as utilities and grid operators work to integrate distributed energy resources (DERs) and demand response (DR) programs to build a more resilient, efficient, and sustainable power grid."
